    {
      "id": 265589,
      "name": "",
      "username": "LonelyMan",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2026-06-03T12:42:03.444Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Loved the intro banter.  They didn’t say anything about why Adam might be grumpy, and I might have wished to hear something about the shift to contractor, but I don’t care.  “Christopher’s Self-Harm corner” is all I could have wished for.</p>\n<p>I enjoyed the doppler effect the first time Christopher did it, before Adam called attention to it.  “Now they went mainstream”, lol.  But seriously, it was cool when I could barely notice it, it was like discovering something.</p>\n<p>To build on my previous comment, the mention of Unity gelled what I would perhaps have preferred.  Her Vengeance story is about Tachyon, her RPG era is about Blade (spoilers lol), but this story would have been a great way to explore why Krystal is a bad person, by seeing her seethe with insane hatred for Devra when they’ve <em>never met</em> before.  Have Unity be freshly hired by Tachyon, left alone for the first time, and suddenly she starts being tormented by this speedster that she never sees, because Friction is impersonating Tacky and trying to gaslight the new intern who replaced her, just tormenting her for nothing resembling any legitimate grievance.  The whole thing could happen <em>before</em> Vengeance, while Friction is still learning how the speedsuit works.</p>\n<p>Dang it!  Maisie <em>Trimbull</em>!  It’s right there!  She’s an intern for a few weeks, why would she have a code name?  Friction should call her Tremble and she should think that’s dumb, but get shouted at if she even starts to complain.  That way her last words can be “don’t $@#%ing call me that.”</p>\n<p>BIK-BOK!!! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/joy.png?v=12\" title=\":joy:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":joy:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/joy.png?v=12\" title=\":joy:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":joy:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/joy.png?v=12\" title=\":joy:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":joy:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/joy.png?v=12\" title=\":joy:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":joy:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/joy.png?v=12\" title=\":joy:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":joy:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Ugh, “Crungeons and Cragons” <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/face_vomiting.png?v=12\" title=\":face_vomiting:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":face_vomiting:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/face_vomiting.png?v=12\" title=\":face_vomiting:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":face_vomiting:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/face_vomiting.png?v=12\" title=\":face_vomiting:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":face_vomiting:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/face_vomiting.png?v=12\" title=\":face_vomiting:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":face_vomiting:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/face_vomiting.png?v=12\" title=\":face_vomiting:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":face_vomiting:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
