      "created_at": "2026-06-04T13:44:18.987Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I got to say after listening to the episode I feel attacked<br>\nEnvy is her flaw, Envy is a problem, Envy is “bad”</p>\n<p>to number one gloon what did you play in the C&amp;C game? were you the guy married to the halfling? were you the CM? You guys were the groomsmen at the Hawk-Glueman wedding right.<br>\nI figure as role-players helping out a buddy, they would be a minion group that cannot take the same action and the one that rolls lowest has their action changed to a boost that affects the rest of the group and is applied before the other actions. some surprisingly good tactics, a bit of luck, teamwork, but also a lot of theory that does not always work in the real world.</p>",
